get m i:96 = b'raw\x01data'
get m i:355 = b'\xe2\x82\xac 100'
show m = ! UnicodeDecodeError: 'ascii' codec can't decode byte 0xe2 in position 0: ordinal not in range(128)
pipe m p 7 @80 = ! UnicodeDecodeError: 'ascii' codec can't decode byte 0xe2 in position 0: ordinal not in range(128)
pipe m p 7: 80 bytes in 12 chunks, 1 messages, b'' left
