pipe r q 1000: 69 bytes in 1 chunks, 1 messages, b'' left
pipe r q 1000 @69 = 8=FIX.4.2|9=47|35=D|5001=10|5002=raw|5000=1|20000=private tag|10=090
pipe r q 1000: 69 bytes in 1 chunks, 1 messages, b'' left
rmraw q i:5001 i:5002 = ! ValueError: list.remove(x): x not in list
pipe m q 1000 = ! TagNotNumberError: invalid literal for int() with base 10: b'data\x0120000'
